{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast off into the cosmos in this high-speed racing game set in the vastness of space! Take control of a nimble spacecraft and navigate through an array of challenging levels, dodging robots, walls, and other dangerous obstacles. Your goal: speed! ...and to eliminate the robot space presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some levels feature a top-down perspective with 2D steering, while others immerse you in a third-person view with full 3D movement. Your best laps generate a ghost spaceship to race against.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your reflexes, timing, and spatial awareness as you race through ever-evolving space environments, where speed is perhaps your only ally, and every turn could mean victory or disaster! GLHF</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722540?t=1759081102","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722540/266b7f57ec23c45469dabbdc1842c4ca4f87dd83/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759081102","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722540/15b7328a61b6272b410e170852f3f4b717ee3ed2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759081102","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722540/15b7328a61b6272b410e170852f3f4b717ee3ed2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759081102","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast off into the cosmos in this high-speed racing game set in the vastness of space! Take control of a nimble spacecraft and navigate through an array of challenging levels, dodging robots, walls, and other dangerous obstacles. Your goal: speed! ...and to eliminate the robot space presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some levels feature a top-down perspective with 2D steering, while others immerse you in a third-person view with full 3D movement. Your best laps generate a ghost spaceship to race against.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your reflexes, timing, and spatial awareness as you race through ever-evolving space environments, where speed is perhaps your only ally, and every turn could mean victory or disaster! GLHF</p>","developers":["Eivind Aanestad"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722540/cb0c23d889db9b18e91487a7287d4784f390dace/header.jpg?t=1759081102","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2025 Eivind Aanestad. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux with gaming.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 163 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Minimalistic graphics.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux with gaming.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 163 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Minimalistic graphics.</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 15.4.1<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon, Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 183 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Minimalistic graphics.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 15.4.1<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon, Intel<br></li><li>